BEGIN:VCALENDAR
PRODID:-//notapattern//calendar export 1.0//EN
VERSION:2.0
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:Buena Vista Social Club
X-WR-TIMEZONE:America/New_York
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:1007171
DTSTAMP:20261016T220347Z
DTSTART:20261016T230000Z
DTEND:20261017T011000Z
SUMMARY:Buena Vista Social Club
LOCATION:Gerald Schoenfeld Theatre, 236 West 45th Street, New York NY 10036
DESCRIPTION:<p>It&rsquo;s been years since legendary singer Omara
  Portuondo last entered a recording studio. Once known as the &ldquo;Queen
  of Feeling,&rdquo; her voice was celebrated throughout Cuba&mdash;until
  she vanished from the spotlight. But when an ambitious young record
  producer brings her a rare opportunity, the elusive diva must finally
  reckon with her past.<br /><br />Hailed as a "jaw-dropping, soul-stirring
  must see" (The Washington Post), the Tony&reg; and Grammy&reg;
  Award-winning <em>Buena Vista Social Club</em>&nbsp;is a journey through
  music and memory into the beating heart of Havana. A world-class company
  brings the story of the iconic album to thrilling life in this tale of big
  dreams, second chances, and music that needs no translation.</p>
END:VEVENT
